<title>USA: Trenwick Group sets stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Trenwick Group sets stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trenwick Group Inc said Wednesday that its board approved a stock repurchase program covering up to one million common shares.</p>
<p>The company also declared a $0.24 per share quarterly cash dividend, unchanged from last quarter. The dividend is payable on June 30 to shareholders of record June 13.</p>
